[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4205.31, "timestamp": "01:10:05", "text": "そうです。悟飯。タマゴ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4207.95, "timestamp": "01:10:07", "text": "悟飯。ハン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4210.28, "timestamp": "01:10:10", "text": "ハン。 ハン。これ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4254.709, "timestamp": "01:10:54", "text": "問題は、私は競争が得意ではないということです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4256.87, "timestamp": "01:10:56", "text": "問題は、もし私がコラボレーションしたい場合"}]